📌 Features
    Takes user input for password length.
    Uses itertools.product to generate all possible passwords of the given length.
    Password characters include:
        Uppercase letters (A–Z)
        Lowercase letters (a–z)
        Digits (0–9)
    Collects and displays the first 20 sample passwords.
    Uses collections.Counter to track and display character frequency from the first 1000 generated passwords.
    Prints the total number of possible passwords for the chosen length.
    Also displays the size of the character set used.


⚙️ Workflow
    User enters desired password length.
    Program generates all possible combinations of letters + digits.
    First 20 passwords are shown as examples.
    Character usage is analyzed on the first 1000 passwords.
    Final summary shows:
    Top 10 most common characters.
    otal password space size (62^length).